// Standalone prototype wrapper for the 2K UI component.
// Run from the game root:  weidu iwd2ee/2k_ui_gate.tp2   (or via a Setup-2k_ui_gate.exe symlink)
//
// This stays a SEPARATE, opt-in component (NOT folded into the GUI-cosmetics component,
// DESIGNATED 37). When both are installed, the gate .tpa additionally 2x's component 37's MOS.
// For real integration, add an equivalent BEGIN to iwd2ee.tp2 using @-strings in tra/<lang>/setup.tra
// (see the EN/FR strings proposed alongside this prototype).

BACKUP   ~iwd2ee/2k_ui_gate_backup~
AUTHOR   ~IWD2EE 2K UI~
VERSION  ~proto~

ALWAYS
  OUTER_SPRINT mod_folder ~iwd2ee~
END

// The name itself warns: only install at >= 2048x1200. The component also prints a resolution
// check at install (warns + still installs, since the player may raise resolution later).
BEGIN ~2K UI: crisp high-resolution interface -- install ONLY if you play at 2048x1200 or higher (e.g. 1440p+)~
DESIGNATED 900
  INCLUDE ~iwd2ee/components/2k_ui_resolution_gate.tpa~
